# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .claudeignore — Norvane
# Tells Claude Code which files and directories to never read or index.
# Syntax mirrors .gitignore. Paths are relative to the project root.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Next.js build output ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 120 MB of webpack cache, compiled chunks, and vendor bundles.
# None of this is source code. Reading any of it wastes 5,000–50,000 tokens.
.next/
out/

# ── Node dependencies ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ~315 MB of third-party packages. Claude should rely on package.json alone
# to understand what libraries are in use. Never enumerate this directory.
node_modules/

# ── TypeScript incremental build cache ───────────────────────────────────────
# 81.8 KB of machine-generated compiler state. ~20,000 tokens if read.
# Provides zero information about application logic.
*.tsbuildinfo

# ── Package lockfile ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 58.8 KB of resolved dependency hashes. Use package.json for dependency info.
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
pnpm-lock.yaml

# ── gstack session data ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Browser automation logs, audit JSONL, port files, and internal tokens.
# 22+ KB of raw session data with no architectural value.
.gstack/

# ── Business documents (not web project source) ───────────────────────────────
# The Word document is a standalone business artifact, not application code.
# The Python script generates business deliverables, not web components.
Norvane_Operator_Playbook.docx
docs/*.docx
docs/*.pdf

# ── Non-project tooling ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# generate_playbook.py is a standalone business tool (~72 KB), irrelevant
# when working on the Next.js web project.
tools/generate_playbook.py

# ── Git internals ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git/

# ── Editor metadata ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/

# ── OS artifacts ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# ── Logs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# ── Environment secrets ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.local
.env*.local
